<title>USA: Intelligent Medical in group-buying deal.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Medical in group-buying deal.</headline>
<dateline>PALM GARDENS, Fla. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelligent Medical Imaging Inc said Wednesday it has entered a three-year group-purchasing agreement with AmeriNet Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement calls for Intelligent Medical to be granted rights to distribute and market the Micro21 automated microscope system to AmeriNet's network of more than 1,900 hospitals and 43 independent laboratories.</p>
<p>Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
